00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.420
No, that is Ariel.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.480
Yeah. I think it's not, it's not a joke.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.060
Like it's so clearly her.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.280
It's like a trace.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:16.100
And, and some of these are like traces off of real people or, or, or like definitely like more anatomically correct people.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:19.420
Like the, the skinhead who's apparently your nemesis.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:28.220
And then there's you who looks like you were pulled out of like a how to manual of how not to die on an airplane.

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:32.120
And then you've got like Rodney and Lester who are more cartoons.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:38.220
And then it goes into a completely different art style when you kill that dog.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:44.700
Don't you think Rodney also is just Rodney Dangerfield and like a weird, like a punk aesthetic of Rodney Dangerfield?

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:48.260
It looks like. I mean, it does look like Rodney Dangerfield.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.620
Oh, you know what? You're right.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.300
I didn't even think about that.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:59.420
Yeah. It's, it's, you know, just to go back to the whole, like you were saying, like they almost like trace over pictures of real people or whatever.

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:04.500
But like, I don't know, I, I, I, I don't hate any of those other characters.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.500
I just hate that.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:09.060
Like they made you the most boring person in the game.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:17.340
Anyway. So you run over the mayor's wife's dog.

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.680
Yeah. And you're the hero.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.520
You're the hero. Yeah.

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.100
Well, because that's the mayor's wife.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:25.080
Nobody likes her. Nobody likes the mayor.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.320
A dog was killed.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.200
The dog is innocent of being the mayor's wife.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.980
You think the dog was killed by the skateboard?

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:32.980
Definitely. Great.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:39.580
So naturally the mayor's wife is, talks to the mayor and says, you got to do something about this.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.260
And he bans skateboarding.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.420
Yeah. I mean, do you see, sorry, just to clarify here.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.980
Do you see the dog in that scene?

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:51.420
Dog's dead. It's the only logical conclusion.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:55.140
Yeah. I've got to say about banning skateboarding.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:59.280
They have no control over this town because there are skateboarders everywhere.

