So maybe this mayor isn't too bad?

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:34.500
You sound like an apologist for the Elwood mayor.

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:40.640
Look, I'm just saying that if somebody kills your dog, there's been movies made about what

