you can do after that.

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:49.520
Do you think that the old lady should have gone on like a John Wick style killing spree?

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:50.620
Doesn't she try to?

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.780
Yeah, she kind of does actually.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.360
She tries to get her revenge.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:58.040
You just wind up fucking her up again.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:00.880
You're like, I'll do what I did to your dog.

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:04.620
And that's the first level.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:11.500
The first level is literally go confront the mayor's wife with a paintball gun in a warehouse

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.080
and defeat her.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.120
I'm glad that you got there.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:23.300
Go ahead. My thing about this level, because it kind of looks almost like a beat-em-up style thing

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:29.400
or whatever, but once you know where to go, there's this door with an arrow pointing into

