00:29:13.460 --> 00:29:15.580
So that that plays into the title.

00:29:17.460 --> 00:29:22.780
And it just seems more of like that sports game that we were we were kind of expecting.

00:29:22.780 --> 00:29:23.600
Yeah.

00:29:23.820 --> 00:29:29.680
Yeah. And I'll just say there was a lot of thought put into this half pipe mode, though, too.

00:29:29.800 --> 00:29:35.560
