00:29:35.560 --> 00:29:39.040
Like there's obviously a score component and a time limit and everything.

00:29:39.220 --> 00:29:48.140
But like if you go into the manual, it's like several pages, like six or seven pages on just like how to use the half pipe,

00:29:48.320 --> 00:29:56.420
like different zones of the half pipe and things to do in them and like different moves for like your which speed you're at and like what's possible,

00:29:56.540 --> 00:30:00.840
like how high in the air you can go, like which moves you have the potential to pull off.

00:30:00.840 --> 00:30:10.200
So like it is a little like it is a little like frustrating that this is just the minigame part and not part of the larger game.

